    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our grand strategy</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/25969c5c3f402271d7264fdc041509db.poster.avif?t=1707237982\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/25969c5c3f402271d7264fdc041509db.webm?t=1707237982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/25969c5c3f402271d7264fdc041509db.mp4?t=1707237982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Tour Manager offers you the role of a director of a travel agency, who has to create a successful business from scratch. You have to hire guides, buy buses, open attractions so that customers are satisfied with the services of your company. Run advertising to attract new customers. Manage the company's finances. This city needs a good travel agency!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your agency's finances</h2>Clients contact your agency to get to know the city better. And after the trip they evaluate the agency. The assessment is influenced by the cost of the trip, the quality of the bus, the skill of the guide, whether the client\u2019s interests are taken into account, and the design of the agency\u2019s office. Therefore, it is necessary to select the price of the tour so that there is money for development, but also not to upset clients. If suddenly there is a miscalculation with financial planning, then the bank will come to the rescue.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/d1a48bd8d2e99e426f96de42ea95bc53.poster.avif?t=1707237982\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/d1a48bd8d2e99e426f96de42ea95bc53.webm?t=1707237982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/d1a48bd8d2e99e426f96de42ea95bc53.mp4?t=1707237982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy new buses</h2>You can add several bus models to the agency's fleet. From low-capacity, slow ones with hard seats, to luxurious high-speed buses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/4829e4f8694c1fe3f051e6572cd8160c.poster.avif?t=1707237982\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/4829e4f8694c1fe3f051e6572cd8160c.webm?t=1707237982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/4829e4f8694c1fe3f051e6572cd8160c.mp4?t=1707237982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan optimal routes</h2>Attractions in the game are divided into 6 categories. Tourists who contact your agency also have their own interests. Some are interested in historical places, some in natural beauty, others are looking for spiritual inspiration. Therefore, it is advisable to plan the bus route so that all passengers find it interesting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop your team</h2>Guides are an important part of the travel agency team. Green novices come to work for your agency, but over time they will become cool professionals. During excursions, guides gain experience and grow in level. When you level up, you can choose a guide perk.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/25969c5c3f402271d7264fdc041509db.poster.avif?t=1707237982\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/25969c5c3f402271d7264fdc041509db.webm?t=1707237982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/25969c5c3f402271d7264fdc041509db.mp4?t=1707237982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Tour Manager offers you the role of a director of a travel agency, who has to create a successful business from scratch. You have to hire guides, buy buses, open attractions so that customers are satisfied with the services of your company. Run advertising to attract new customers. Manage the company's finances. This city needs a good travel agency!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage your agency's finances</h2>Clients contact your agency to get to know the city better. And after the trip they evaluate the agency. The assessment is influenced by the cost of the trip, the quality of the bus, the skill of the guide, whether the client\u2019s interests are taken into account, and the design of the agency\u2019s office. Therefore, it is necessary to select the price of the tour so that there is money for development, but also not to upset clients. If suddenly there is a miscalculation with financial planning, then the bank will come to the rescue.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/d1a48bd8d2e99e426f96de42ea95bc53.poster.avif?t=1707237982\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/d1a48bd8d2e99e426f96de42ea95bc53.webm?t=1707237982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/d1a48bd8d2e99e426f96de42ea95bc53.mp4?t=1707237982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy new buses</h2>You can add several bus models to the agency's fleet. From low-capacity, slow ones with hard seats, to luxurious high-speed buses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/4829e4f8694c1fe3f051e6572cd8160c.poster.avif?t=1707237982\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/4829e4f8694c1fe3f051e6572cd8160c.webm?t=1707237982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2662080/extras/4829e4f8694c1fe3f051e6572cd8160c.mp4?t=1707237982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan optimal routes</h2>Attractions in the game are divided into 6 categories. Tourists who contact your agency also have their own interests. Some are interested in historical places, some in natural beauty, others are looking for spiritual inspiration. Therefore, it is advisable to plan the bus route so that all passengers find it interesting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Develop your team</h2>Guides are an important part of the travel agency team. Green novices come to work for your agency, but over time they will become cool professionals. During excursions, guides gain experience and grow in level. When you level up, you can choose a guide perk.",
    "short_description": "Head a travel agency and unravel the mysteries of this city! Hire employees, plan tourist routes, improve the reputation of the agency. Advance through the story to find out what this city is hiding.",
